# Metal shader build artifacts: ocudu_mmse.metallib is regenerated IN PLACE in this
# source directory at build time (see CMakeLists.txt / cmake/modules/ocudu_metal.cmake),
# so it must never be committed again. The .air/.air.d intermediates stay in the build
# directory, but ignore them here too in case of a manual xcrun run.
*.metallib
*.air
*.air.d
